# Flying shapes (the box)

An assemblage of moving shapes. Other pages may add new `Shape` implementers
through `Game::addShape`. Circle, Square, and Triangle stay private; only the
`Shape` contract, `make`, `addShape`, and `update` cross the membrane.

`[[flyingB]]` imports this page and adds a Pentagon.

`Shape::step` takes a width, not a `Rect`, so importers do not need this page's
layout.

## Schema

```
Game = PlayArea [Shape]/shapes $Time
PlayArea = Rect
Rect = Int/x Int/y Int/width Int/height
Shape = Circle | Square | Triangle
Circle = Int/x Int/y Int/radius Int/dx
Square = Int/x Int/y Int/side Int/dx
Triangle = Int/x Int/y Int/base Int/height Int/dx
Time = Int/t
```

## Construction

```
[:Game
  [:PlayArea [0 0 800 600]]
  [:Array/Shape
    [:Circle 80 120 24 5]
    [:Square 220 280 40 3]
    [:Triangle 520 400 50 45 4]
  ]
  [:Time 0]
]
```

## Methods

```
Time::update! = { [:Time (t + 1)] }

Shape::step = { Int/width | } -> Shape

Circle::step = { Int/width |
  nx = (x + dx) % width.
  [:Circle nx y radius dx]
}

Square::step = { Int/width |
  nx = (x + dx) % width.
  [:Square nx y side dx]
}

Triangle::step = { Int/width |
  nx = (x + dx) % width.
  [:Triangle nx y base height dx]
}

Game::addShape = { Shape/s |
  [:Game playArea shapes.cons(s) time]
}

Game::update! = {
  moved = shapes.map({ Shape/s | s.step(playArea.rect.width) }).
  [:Game playArea moved time]
}

Shape::draw = { @Graphics/g | } -> Void

Circle::draw = { @Graphics/g |
  g.beginFill(15316448).drawCircle(x, y, radius).endFill()
} -> Void

Square::draw = { @Graphics/g |
  g.beginFill(988016).drawRect(x, y, side, side).endFill()
} -> Void

Triangle::draw = { @Graphics/g |
  g.beginFill(5453955).moveTo(x, y).lineTo(x + base, y).lineTo(x + (base / 2), y - height).lineTo(x, y).endFill()
} -> Void
```

## Public

```
Shape
```


## Target

```
%canvas

%requires
Graphics

%init
var assemblage;

function init() {
    assemblage = GameAssemblage.factory();
}

%step
function step() {
    assemblage.time["update!"]();
    var r = assemblage.playArea.rect;
    wchntGraphics.clear();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0x1a1a2e);
    wchntGraphics.drawRect(r.x, r.y, r.width, r.height);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    for (var s of assemblage.shapes) {
        s.draw(wchntGraphics);
    }
}
```
